<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1078628" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute rend="center">Viro pereximio at<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> Clarissimo
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Petro Antonio Michelotto</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Johannes Bernoull<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></rs></salute></opener>
  <p><lb/><rs key="B_991170515020405501" type="letter">Litter<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> tu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> die 8 Jun<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice> script<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> primo aspectu quidem
      <lb/>jucundissim<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> me postea primas lineas legentem non leviter
      <lb/>perculerunt, cum ex iis statim intellexi, quod meas <rs key="B_991170515020505501" type="letter">litteras</rs>
      <lb/>jam 15 Ma<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice> exaratas at<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> <rs key="B_991170517053905501" type="letter">eas</rs> quas Agnatus meus <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaus</rs> ad
      <lb/>Te scripserat<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Dem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517053905501">Brief Nicolaus I Bernoullis vom 15. Mai 1714</rs> lag <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515020505501">Johanns Brief an Michelotti vom selben Tag</rs> bei.</note> quibus<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> <rs key="B_991170515020505501" type="letter">ill<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> erant inclus<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, nondum acce<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>peris, cum tamen per temporis spatium sat longum jam
      <lb/>diu Tibi tradit<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> esse potuissent et debuissent: utrum vero
      <lb/>ab eo tempore ad Te nunc pervenerint nec ne lubens <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> Te intel<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ligam, cui vero rei ascribenda sit illa litterarum in itinere re<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tardatio haud probe scio, nisi forte in causa sint lites crebr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>et dissensiones qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> intercedunt nostris postarum directoribus
      <lb/>cum Mediolanensibus <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> quibus litter<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> nostr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> in <rs key="place_KON-italie" type="place">Italiam</rs>
      <lb/>mittend<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> prim<choice><orig><g ref="#ugrav">ù</g></orig><reg>u</reg></choice>m accept<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> alterius expediri deberent:<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Bernoulli vermutet, dass Streitigkeiten zwischen den Basler und den Mailänder Postverantwortlichen die Zustellung verzögert hätten. Nicolaus I Bernoulli schreibt in seinem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517053305501">Brief an Michelotti vom 8. August 1714</rs>, ihnen sei von solchen Streitigkeiten und von monatelang in Mailand zurückgehaltenen Briefen berichtet worden. Ihre Schreiben vom 18. Juli hatten beide deshalb über Tirol und Innsbruck versandt.</note> Inte<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rim ne me iterum incerto litterarum fato committam,
      <lb/>lubet hasce per <rs key="place_VER-tirola" type="place">Tyrolim</rs> utut longiorem nonnihil viam ad
      <lb/>Te amandare; nec male me judice facies si eadem via uti vo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lueris cum quid nobis perscribendum habueris.</p>
  <p><lb/>Ut nunc ad rem ipsam veniam, cujus de causa me <rs key="B_991170515020405501" type="letter">litteris
      <lb/>Tuis</rs> cohonest<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>sti: Perspexeris uti<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> ex <rs key="B_991170515020505501" type="letter">prioribus meis</rs> (nisi perie<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>
<pb facs="1078629" n="2"/>
      <lb break="no"/>rint omnino) quis sit rerum mearum status, et quam
      <lb/>multa sint obstacula tantum non insuperabilia, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>discessum meum si non impediunt saltem difficillimum
      <lb/>reddunt: <rs key="B_991170517053905501" type="letter">Apographum</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">In seinem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517053905501">Brief an Michelotti vom 15. Mai 1714</rs> übermittelte Nicolaus I Bernoulli einen umfangreichen Auszug aus <rs type="letter" key="B_991170514861105501">Johanns Brief an Fardella vom 14. Februar 1714</rs>. Dieser Auszug enthält sowohl die Einwände gegen einen Wohnortswechsel als auch den Vorbehalt, dass die Hindernisse nur durch eine aussergewöhnliche Verbesserung der wirtschaftlichen Lage zu überwinden wären.</note> tibi misit <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatus</rs> meus <rs key="B_991170514861105501" type="letter">littera<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rum</rs> quarundam quas dedi ad <choice><abbr>Illustr.</abbr><expan>Illustrissimum</expan></choice> Abbatem <rs key="pers_DE-588-119291967" type="person">Fardel<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lam</rs><supplied>,</supplied> in illis fusius deduxi rationes meas gravissimas, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>animum meum quantumvis pronum ad Provinciam in <rs type="organisation">Ar<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>chilyceo Patavino</rs> amplectendam fortiter retrahunt; Has eas<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dem ob rationes recusavi jam plures vocationes splendidis<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>simas ad Illustrissimas <rs type="organisation">Academias Belgicas</rs> lautissimis
      <lb/>conditionibus stipatas, quibus si vel maxime Religioni me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> in Regionibus illis colitur vel utilitati me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>privat<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> velificari voluissem, reluctari non debuissem:
      <lb/>Ideo<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> in <rs key="B_991170515020505501" type="letter">pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>cedentibus meis</rs> vobis commendavi <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicola<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs>,
      <lb/>utpote qui in cognitione rei mathematic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> mihi plane
      <lb/>non est impar et quod ad <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>tatis vigorem me longe
      <lb/>superior; nondum enim pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>tergressus est annum
      <lb/>vigesimum octavum, quum ego haud multum absim
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> quinquagesimo <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>tatis anno; Unde vides vir doctis<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>sime, illum etsi <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>tate non adeo provectum non tamen
      <lb/>Juvenem esse multominus rudem et Tyronem veluti
      <lb/>ejus adversarii falso ogganniunt, quibus autem os ob<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>
<pb facs="1078630" n="3"/>
      <lb break="no"/>turari potest <rs key="biblio_L8VT6JV7 biblio_ME943KC7 biblio_LHPKQS5I biblio_V8JI9SUL biblio_3UJF5A2X biblio_3CSSKGCT biblio_HDAFSIQR biblio_XI99B6CE biblio_EUPETZBM" type="biblio">variis speciminibus</rs> in publicum editis,
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> a Mathematicis primariis magni <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stimantur, exta<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rent in eam rem testimonia, si Proximi mei consanguinei
      <lb/>justissimam laudem depr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>dicare modestia non vetaret: Lege
      <lb/>modo ubi acceperis, <rs key="pers_DE-588-117601020" type="person">Montmortii</rs> alteram Editionem libri cui
      <lb/>titulus <rs key="biblio_RTB4565Q" type="biblio"><hi rend="u">Essai d’analyse sur les jeux de hazard</hi></rs>, videbis ex
      <lb/>plurimis qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ibi insert<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> sunt epistolis ab <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnato</rs> meo et
      <lb/>ex elogiis quibus eum cumulat <rs key="pers_DE-588-117601020" type="person">Montmortius</rs> Vir doctus et
      <lb/>ingenuus at<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> ab assentatione longe alienissimus, videbis in<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>quam quid pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stiterit <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaus</rs> quid<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> porro ubi occasio se ob<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tulerit pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stare queat: Equidem puto copiam materi<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>ipsi non deesse, quam nunc pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>lo committat at<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice>
      <lb/><choice><abbr>illustriss.</abbr><expan>illustrissimis</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Excellentiss.</abbr><expan>Excellentissimis</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410 pers_DE-588-1111043582 pers_DE-588-1178371670" type="person">Moderatoribus</rs> <rs type="organisation">Archilycei
      <lb/>Patavini</rs> dedicet nisi satius videretur ab eo molimine
      <lb/>abstinere ante vocationem, quia <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> malevolis quibusdam
      <lb/>in sequiorem partem verti posset, et accipi pro ambitu
      <lb/>et tanto quidem turpiori si postea cariturus esset felici
      <lb/>successu. Hoc addere adhuc lubet; quod <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatus</rs> meus
      <lb/>conduci poterit salario ordinario hoc est tali quod
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-119112450" type="person">Hermannianum</rs> non excedat; Cum <choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> contrario magna
      <lb/>de quibus supra obstacula qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> mea sunt parte ma<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gnum etiam requirant pondus quo amoveri possint,
<pb facs="1078631" n="4"/>
      <lb/>et durus nodus durum cuneum; facile percipies Vir
      <lb/>Clarissime, mihi offerendum stipendium esse nec mediocre
      <lb/>nec ordinarium fortassis miraberis si dixero me ne quidem
      <lb/>permotum iri oblata summa minori quam 1500 thaleror<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>imperialium hoc est totidem unciarum argenti nisi enim
      <lb/>insigne fortun<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> augmentum (quo et mihi et Famili<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>satis numeros<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> prospicere possim) pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> oculis quasi videam;
      <lb/>oper<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> pretium non duco tantam et tam molestam
      <lb/>hac qua sum <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>tate subire mutationem: Jussisti me pos<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cere tam honorificum stipendium quam mihi luberet;
      <lb/>quod si vero ejusmodi petitum enorme Tibi videatur
      <lb/>at<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> durum, scias me nihil petere at<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> permittere ut
      <lb/>hanc meam epistolam supprimas et tanquam non scrip<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tam censeas: Si deinde aliquid adhuc pro <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnato</rs>
      <lb/>meo effici poterit ejus commodum tu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> benevolenti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>proporro commendatum cupio. Ad Reliqua Epistol<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>tu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> capita<rs type="letter"/><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Gemeint ist Michelottis <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515020405501">Brief an Johann I Bernoulli vom 8. Juni 1714</rs>. Auf die darin erbetene Zusendung von Schriften geht Nicolaus I Bernoulli in seinem beigefügten <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517053705501">Brief an Michelotti vom 18. Juli 1714</rs> ein.</note> respondet <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaus</rs> <rs key="B_991170517053705501" type="letter">in suis hisce adjectis</rs><supplied>.</supplied></p>
  <closer><salute><lb/>Vale Vir Clarissime.</salute>
<dateline><choice><orig>d</orig><reg>D</reg></choice>abam <rs key="place_GEO-2661604" type="place">Basile<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> <date when="1714-07-23">18 Juli 1714.</date></dateline></closer>
  <postscript><p><lb/>P. S.<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Das Postskriptum ist von Johann I Bernoulli eigenhändig geschrieben.</note> Conabimur desiderio tuo satisfacere missu scripto<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rum tam <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> fratre quam <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me editorum saltem eorum
        <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> conquirere vel colligere possumus, nam maxima pars
        <lb/>non amplius in potestate mea sunt, et qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>dam in
        <lb/>potestate nunquam fuere, ut sunt ea qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> in variis
        <lb/>operibus menstruis prodierunt. Ex mittendis fasciculum
        <lb/>faciemus cui includet <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatus</rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-117601020" type="person">Montmortii</rs> <rs key="biblio_RTB4565Q" type="biblio">Librum supra me<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>moratum</rs> quam primum illum accipiet: sicuti ni fallor ipse
        <lb/>in suis hisce adjectis monuit.</p></postscript>
